@page "/about"
@{ ViewData["Title"]="About"; ViewData["Description"]="About Cerebral Ops and its founder."; }
<section class="page-section"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-9 mx-auto"><h1 class="section-title">Helping businesses grow smarter, not louder.</h1><p class="lead">Cerebral Ops brings clarity, intelligence, and disciplined execution to consulting.</p><p>We combine strategic depth with hands-on execution across AI, cloud, software, process, operations, and growth systems.</p><div class="row g-4 mt-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><h3>Clarity Over Complexity</h3><p>We simplify the noise and define what must happen next.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><h3>Strategy + Execution</h3><p>Our work connects strategic thinking to practical implementation.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="value-card"><h3>Empathy</h3><p>Partnership begins with listening, not prescribing.</p></div></div></div><div class="value-card mt-5"><h2>Meet the Founder</h2><p>Deepkumar Janardhanan has spent his career helping businesses make smarter decisions, build better systems, and scale with intention.</p><p>Across AI, software, cloud, ecommerce, and operations, he saw teams struggling with clarity, alignment, and consistent execution. Cerebral Ops was created to address that gap.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
